This lab successfully demonstrates building a full-stack MERN (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js) Todo application from scratch. Key accomplishments include:

Setting up a Node.js/Express backend with RESTful API endpoints (GET, POST, DELETE)

Integrating MongoDB Atlas for cloud database storage with Mongoose ODM

Creating a React frontend with components for input, listing, and deleting todos

Using concurrently to run both servers simultaneously during development

Implementing full CRUD functionality with proper error handling and validation

The completed application provides a functional Todo manager where users can add, view, and delete tasks, showcasing core MERN stack concepts in practice.
